<title>USA: USFreightways stock offered at $23.50/shr.</title>
<headline>USFreightways stock offered at $23.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Freightways Corp said Wednesday its public offer of 2.7 million common shares has been priced at $23.50 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it is offering all of the stock in an offer being underwritten by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co.</p>
<p>USFreightways operated five regional general commodities carriers which provide overnight and second-day delivery throughout the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 5/16 at 23-15/16.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
